  "description": "A data grid component for the NE.Standard UI framework: the table with everything the built-in one leaves to an add-on — sorting by header, typed and formatted columns, editing in place, filters and a search box, paging, a footer of totals, pinned and responsive columns with a chooser, a detail row and CSV export. Platform-independent; the web rendering is NE.Standard.UI.Web.DataGrid.",
